# twin: render_one
# vulkan/one with a core that sets a version 2 context negotiation
# interface: its create_instance and create_device2 make the instance and
# the device through the harness's wrappers, which add the validation
# layer under --vk-validate.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate v2
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
